      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "H10 IC was positive in 2024-2026 (+0.274684, 62 dates), 2027-2029 (+0.102027, 782), 2030-2032 (+0.123905, 784), and 2033-2035 (+0.076526, 703). 2020-2023 had no eligible dates because the 120-day warmup exceeded the short synthetic-history regime segment. Small cross-asset universe implies conservative uncertainty interpretation.",
